      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner challenged the order of punishment by way of appeal and it was dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "837a0426062c4f10b8bcce8ab6c7f144_9",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Subsequently this Court modified the punishment as 'censure' in WP(MD)No.1342 of 2023 vide order dated 24.09.2024."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59553c033f984033a4057d8c6dfe8b6c_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It appears that this charge memo was issued based on the information provided before this Court in M. Kannathasan vs The Principal Secretary To Government on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/127413415/\n3 WP(MD)N"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c49f49296e084ccfa58f1db929eb2d54_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Apart from the said charges, this Court has recorded the allegation of the petitioners therein that one of the lessees has bribed this petitioner /\nthen Executive Officer to an extent of Rs.5 lakh for allotment of temple shops without any l"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2d9a838ada02436eab3bbeb7fa5f1eee_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
