      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has challenged the charge memo dated 25.08.2023 in WP(MD)No.27170 of https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 2023, wherein this Court has by order dated 29.04.2024 directed that necessary orders have to be passed within a period of f"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f404950025549e891d0777dc06cd169_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the meantime on 04.09.2024 the petitioner has requested to change the enquiry officer and accepting his request the government has changed the enquiry officer on 12.11.2024."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dab486151eb34658961c1373fcbf4cb5_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It appears that the petitioner has also filed a contempt petition in Cont P(MD)No.2502 of 2024, wherein this Court has recorded the request made by the petitioner for change of enquiry officer accepted by the government by changing the enqu"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "78348683ff3841a48784364a04912e8e_49",
