      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9.The petitioner had already challenged the charge memo dated 25.08.2023 in WP(MD)No.27170 of 2023 and he has not taken any ground that the charges are wrongly framed under Rule 17(b) of TNCS(D&A) Rules."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c264534311a4e00a633add57c7bd490_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "While so the petitioner has approached this Court with this writ petition with this new ground."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b9abdf4797d4bc1b38ee5a21b92f804_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
